{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jenny's Adventure is a 2D platformer where you guide Jenny, a cat, through an interconnected world of biomes. Use abilities like wall jumps and sprints while managing stamina to explore and collect flowers. Focused on platforming and discovery, it offers a relaxing, combat-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.poster.avif?t=1748489995\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.webm?t=1748489995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.mp4?t=1748489995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> With a heavy emphasis on exploration and discovery, Jenny's Adventures is a metroidvania filled with unlockable abilities and secrets. Find your way to the summit using your curiosity as the guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features an interconnected world with different biomes. Uncover a world with areas like forests and beaches. Use your skills to tackle several platforming puzzles to find the path to an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumping:</strong> Jenny's Adventures uses a slightly different approach to jumping which is commonly seen in traditional platformers. Player needs to hold the jump button and then release it. If the player releases in a specific window, it results in a 'perfect jump' which increases the jump height.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game also features a stamina system. Some abilities like sprinting consumes stamina which can be refilled by collecting flowers or perfect jumps.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149660?t=1748489995","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149660?t=1748489995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/f3a5d1698c8a1c3af49f7d9ef29b02811b55c5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748489995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/f3a5d1698c8a1c3af49f7d9ef29b02811b55c5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748489995","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jenny's Adventure is a 2D platformer where you guide Jenny, a cat, through an interconnected world of biomes. Use abilities like wall jumps and sprints while managing stamina to explore and collect flowers. Focused on platforming and discovery, it offers a relaxing, combat-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.poster.avif?t=1748489995\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.webm?t=1748489995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/0710eddac7c6b34b7a2473a0ebb9a38f.mp4?t=1748489995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> With a heavy emphasis on exploration and discovery, Jenny's Adventures is a metroidvania filled with unlockable abilities and secrets. Find your way to the summit using your curiosity as the guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features an interconnected world with different biomes. Uncover a world with areas like forests and beaches. Use your skills to tackle several platforming puzzles to find the path to an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumping:</strong> Jenny's Adventures uses a slightly different approach to jumping which is commonly seen in traditional platformers. Player needs to hold the jump button and then release it. If the player releases in a specific window, it results in a 'perfect jump' which increases the jump height.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game also features a stamina system. Some abilities like sprinting consumes stamina which can be refilled by collecting flowers or perfect jumps.</p>","developers":["Pranav Gaur"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/header.jpg?t=1748489995","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3149660/866118/ee43d7c3fe6069b3ab69deeb36be19f58a418a07/1750875260/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744125388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3149660/866118/ee43d7c3fe6069b3ab69deeb36be19f58a418a07/1750875260/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744125388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3149660/866118/ee43d7c3fe6069b3ab69deeb36be19f58a418a07/1750875260/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744125388","id":257123671,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.